cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this index or dataset, please cite the companion paper below."
title: "A Rare-Earth Supply Uncertainty (REU) Index"
abstract: >-
  A search-based Rare-Earth Supply Uncertainty (REU) index measuring reported
  disruptions to the global supply of rare-earth elements. Building on Baker,
  Bloom, and Davis (2016), the index tracks the frequency of news articles
  jointly referencing rare-earth elements and supply-shortage language, from
  January 2008 onward.
type: dataset
authors:
  - family-names: "Morão"
    given-names: "Hugo"
license: CC-BY-4.0
keywords:
  - rare earth elements
  - supply shortage
  - critical minerals
  - green transition
  - text mining
